While our primary focus is on scientific data, we include results on standard vision benchmarks to contextualize DSD’s performance to the computer vision community.



\subsection{MNIST experiments}
\label{app:mnist}

As an initial validation, we trained an unconditional DSD model on MNIST and found that it reliably captures digit structure and diversity (Fig.~\ref{fig:mnist_unconditional}).


