where $\mathcal{P}(\eta_n)=\bigl\{\bigl\lceil\frac{M\cdot\chi_{\text{min}}(\eta_n)}{2}\bigl\rceil,\cdots,-1,1,\cdots, \bigl\lfloor\frac{M\cdot\chi_{\text{max}}(\eta_n)}{2}\bigl\rfloor\bigl\}$ with
$\chi_{\text{min}}(\eta_n)=\underset{|\omega|\leq\phi_{\text{max}}}{\text{min}}\sin(\omega-\eta_n)$
