$|r(\phi,\eta_n)|$ in (\ref{steering_eff00}) achieves the minimum value 0 if and only if $\phi=\arcsin\left(\frac{2p}{M}\right)+\eta_n$, $\forall p\in\mathcal{P}(\eta_n)$.
