\begin{cor}\label{lemma2DRAA0}
For given any sULA $n$ with orientation $\eta_n$,
the null-to-null mainlobe beamwidth is
\begin{equation}\label{BW}
\phi_{\text{BW}}=2\arcsin\Bigl(\frac{2}{M}\Bigl).
