\end{aligned}
\end{equation}

It is noted that the noise at the $M$-element ULA, denoted by $\vec{z}'\in \mathbb{C}^{M\times 1}$, follows i.i.d. CSCG distribution with variance $\sigma^2$, i.e., $\vec{z}'\sim N_{\mathbb{C}}\left(0,\sigma^2\vec{I}_{M}\right)$.
