\subsection{Open Source Generic PDES-AI Framework}
Our Simian PDES based AI/non-AI hybrid agent simulator has been designed in a generic manner with a view to enable its use in complex, real-world reasoning problems of broader research interest, more diverse than the relatively simple, yet representative case-studies presented in this paper. The authors of this paper intend to open-source the entire PDES-AI simulator framework code for research purposes.

