\section{Experiments and Results}
\label{sec:results}
In this section we discuss the experimental setup and results in detail.

\subsection{Hardware Setup}
We use a cluster of six x86 computer nodes connected in a single network to run the MPI enabled parallel discrete event simulations. Each node has an Nvidia Volta GPU~\cite{v100} from the Volta series architecture~\cite{volta-v100} attached to it. Table~\ref{tab:node_config} shows the configuration of each node.

