Additionally, we evaluate quadratic forms
\begin{equation}
   \IK := \int_{\Omega}  c_K(\x) \big(\nabla \vx \cdot \nabla \vx\big) \dxdydz \, , \qquad 
   \IM := \int_{\Omega}  c_M(\x) \big(\vx\big)^2 \dxdydz \, 
