Let $n_\sigma := |P\cap \sigma|$ for each cell $\sigma$.
Note that $|\widehat{P}_i\cap\sigma|=\OO(\frac{n_\sigma}{\ceil{L/2^i}})$
and $|\widehat{Q}_i\cap\sigma'|=\OO(\frac{n_{\sigma'}}{2^i})$ for every $(\sigma,\sigma')$ w.h.p.
We already have a selection oracle for each $\delta(\widehat{P}_i\cap\sigma,\widehat{Q}_i\cap\sigma')$
that w.h.p.\ runs in time
\[
