$\mathcal R(x_{\alpha}^{\delta})$ is non-increasing, whereas $G(x_{\alpha}^{\delta})$ and $m(\alpha)$ are non-decreasing with respect to $\alpha\in (0, \infty)$.
\end{lemma}

