Lastly, we estimate $\bm{\xi}_{3}^{(j+1)} = \{\xi_{3, k}^{(j+1)}\}_{k = 0}^{K} \ \in \mathbb{R}^{K+1}$ and $\bm{\xi}_{6}^{(j+1)} = \{\xi_{6, k}^{(j+1)}\}_{k = 0}^{K} \ \in \mathbb{R}^{K+1}$. 
By using (A2), we have 
