where $C_{1}$ is a constant defined by \eqref{eta_bound}.
Additionally, we see from the property of the difference quotient that
\begin{gather*}
	\gamma_{\varepsilon}\bigl( \delta_{k}^{+}\tilde{\theta}_{k}^{(j)}\bigr) - \gamma_{\varepsilon}\bigl( \partial_{x}\theta_{k}^{(j+1)}\bigr) 
