\subsection{Segmentation Results}
After generating the knowledge graph, two SimpleMind modules were invoked automatically via a terminal-execution LLM agent: (1) SM-Learn for any tools with trainable weights, and (2) SM-Think for inference using those trained weights. 

On the test set, the system performed with a mean dice coefficient of 0.824 for heart segmentation (49 test cases) , 0.963 for lungs segmentation  (50 test cases) , and 0.830 for ribs    (50 test cases).  Example image segmentation results from the test set are shown in Figure \ref{fig:segmentation_results}.



