 $$(\div \sigma|_{T_i}(z) - q_i(z)) \cdot n_{i+1} = 0.$$
 Thanks for \eqref{eq:lag-cond-typeII}, the above equation also holds for $i = 6$. Thus, we finish the first step of construction. 

For the second step, we construct $\tilde{\sigma}$ such that 
 $(\div \sigma|_{T_i}(z) + \div \tilde\sigma|_{T_i}(z) -  q_i(z))  = 0.$
