\section{Conclusion}
In conclusion, we accelerate GNN training in the original Exa.TrkX particle tracking pipeline. All of our code is available at \href{https://github.com/PASSIONLab/CAGNET}{\color{blue}{https://github.com/PASSIONLab/CAGNET}}.
