\textit{Paper organization.} The remainder of the paper is organized as follows.
Section~\ref{sec:sensitivity_analysis} discusses the sensitivity of $J$ with respect to the unknown inclusion $\omega$ and the unknown Robin coefficient $\alpha$.
Section~\ref{sec:numerical_experiments} presents a numerical algorithm based on the shape derivative of $J$ with respect to $\omega$ and the Fr\'{e}chet derivative of $J$ with respect to the parameter $\alpha$.
The proposed numerical method is then tested through various numerical examples.

