%Furthermore, their continuous sampling and high power requirements contrast sharply with the efficient, event-driven nature of biological interaction~\cite{raman2011mimicking}. These fundamental differences between artificial and biological odor detection mechanisms remain key challenges in the development of effective neuromorphic olfactory systems.


