\subsection{Developer Experiences with AI Tools}

Prior research has also explored the strategies that developers 
apply when using AI~\cite{hai_ide_litrev},
especially prompt engineering strategies for 
developers~\cite{braberman2024taskspeopleprompttaxonomy, promptstaxo, santu2023telergeneraltaxonomyllm}.
